  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "number": 1,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Graph Theory",
        "zh": "图论"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Draw an undirected graph representing the following information using the first letter of each person’s name. Which person has the most friends?\n\nAnn is friends with Deb and Eve. Eve is friends with Ann and Carol. Deb is friends with Carol and Fran. Fran is friends with Ann and Carol. Carol is friends with Beth and Ann. Beth is friends with Eve and Deb.",
        "zh": "用每个人姓名的首字母表示顶点，根据以下信息画出无向图。谁的朋友最多？\n\nAnn 与 Deb、Eve 是朋友。Eve 与 Ann、Carol 是朋友。Deb 与 Carol、Fran 是朋友。Fran 与 Ann、Carol 是朋友。Carol 与 Beth、Ann 是朋友。Beth 与 Eve、Deb 是朋友。"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "Ann",
            "zh": "Ann"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "Beth",
            "zh": "Beth"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "Carol",
            "zh": "Carol"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "Deb",
            "zh": "Deb"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "Eve",
            "zh": "Eve"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "The undirected edges are $AC, AD, AE, AF, BC, BD, BE, CD, CE, CF, DF$. Count each friendship only once. Carol is adjacent to A, B, D, E and F, so she has 5 friends, the most. Answer C.",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n把每一对朋友连成一条无向边。Carol 的邻居是 A、B、D、E、F，因此她的度数是 5。图中只有 6 人，任一人最多有 5 个朋友，核对其余人的邻居可见没有人和她并列。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          3
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
