    {
      "id": "q2",
      "number": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Graph Theory",
        "zh": "图论"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "For the given graph, how many more edges are needed for this graph to be a complete graph?\n\n{{diagram:elementary-q2-graph}}",
        "zh": "要使下图成为完全图，还需要添加多少条边？\n\n{{diagram:elementary-q2-graph}}"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "1",
            "zh": "1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "2",
            "zh": "2"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "3",
            "zh": "3"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "4",
            "zh": "4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "5",
            "zh": "5"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "A complete graph on 5 vertices has $\\binom{5}{2}=10$ edges. The graph has 7 edges. Add $QR$, $RT$ and $PS$, so 3 more edges are needed. Answer C.",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n完全图要求任意两点之间都有边。5 个顶点有 $\\binom{5}{2}=10$ 对，原图已经连了 7 对。缺失的边是 $QR$、$RT$ 和 $PS$，所以要补 3 条。"
      },
